{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07512","headline":"送杜越江佐觐省往新安江 · 刘长卿","name":"送杜越江佐觐省往新安江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去帆楚天外，望远愁复积。\n想见新安江，扁舟一行客。\n清流数千丈，底下看白石。\n色混元气深，波连洞庭碧。\n鸣桹去未已，前路行可觌。\n猨鸟悲啾啾，杉松雨声夕。\n送君东赴归宁期，新安江水远相随。\n见说江中孤屿在，此行应赋谢公诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}